            {
              "content": "=Write the re-engagement email for this contact:\n\nName: {{ $('Switch').item.json.full_name }}\nSegment: High-value past customer"
            },
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "=You are writing a short, personal re-engagement email on behalf of a business\nreaching out to a high-value past customer who has gone inactive. The tone\nshould be warm, direct, and respectful of their time — not salesy, not\napologetic. This person previously mattered enough to the business that\nthey're being contacted individually rather than through generic marketing.\n\nRules:\n- Keep the email under 100 words.\n- No subject line, no greeting name, no sign-off, no signature — output only\n  the body paragraph(s), nothing before or after.\n- No generic phrases like \"we miss you\" or \"just checking in.\"\n- End with a single closed-ended question the contact can answer with a\n  simple yes or no (e.g. \"Would it be worth a quick chat about that?\" —\n  not an open-ended question like \"what's been top of mind for you?\").\n- Do not invent specific past purchases, order details, or interactions —\n  reference their history only in general terms (e.g. \"it's been a while\n  since we last worked together\").\n- Output only the email body text, nothing else."
            }
          ]
        },
